---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Fundar Labs — Pronto"
  description="Agentes agénticos que trabajan 24/7 para los procesos que te limitan. Diseñamos soluciones de inteligencia artificial para negocios en México."
>
  <main class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden hero-grad noise flex flex-col">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="relative z-30 pt-10 sm:pt-14">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-ember-400 to-ember-600 text-navy-950 font-bold text-sm">FL</span>
          <span class="font-serif text-xl text-sand-50 tracking-tight">Fundar Labs</span>
        </a>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-ember-300/90">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ember-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Pronto
        </span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="relative flex-1 flex items-center">
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 text-center">
        <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-ember-300/90 mb-8">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-ember-400/70"></span>
          Jalisco · México
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-ember-400/70"></span>
        </p>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-[1.02] text-sand-50">
          Fundar Labs
        </h1>

        <p class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-tight text-sand-100/90 mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Agentes agénticos que trabajan 24/7 para los procesos que te limitan.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-10 text-base sm:text-lg text-sand-100/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Diseñamos soluciones de inteligencia artificial para que tu negocio automatice lo que antes requería contratar personal: agendar, documentar, dar seguimiento, calificar prospectos, responder fuera de horario.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-ember-300/90">
          Pronto lanzamos.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="mailto:miguel@fundarlabs.com.mx?subject=Quiero%20saber%20más%20de%20Fundar%20Labs"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-ember-500 hover:bg-ember-400 text-navy-950 font-semibold text-sm transition-colors shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(249,122,18,0.35),0_12px_40px_-8px_rgba(249,122,18,0.6)]"
          >
            Déjanos tu correo
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:miguel@fundarlabs.com.mx"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-full text-sm text-sand-50/85 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/25 transition-colors"
          >
            miguel@fundarlabs.com.mx
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="relative z-10 border-t border-white/5">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:items-center sm:justify-between text-xs text-sand-100/55">
        <p>Fundar Labs · Jalisco, México</p>
        <p>© 2026 Fundar Labs. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>
